c06|n|A movable single seat with a back. ; An official seat, as of a chief magistrate or a judge, but esp. that of a professor; hence, the office itself. ; The presiding officer of an assembly; a chairman; as, to address the chair. ; A vehicle for one person; either a sedan borne upon poles, or two-wheeled carriage, drawn by one horse; a gig. ; An iron block used on railways to support the rails and secure them to the sleepers.	a:otv,94,4;1dky,23,8~1dky,23,8;otv,94,4	v:otv,84,2~otv,84,2	V:15mn,44,3~15mn,44,3	n:jgz,75,82;1vj7,68,4;ef1,65,18;1iag,61,8;1nc6,49,17;f0c,33,4;4j6,20,2~jgz,75,82;ef1,65,18;1nc6,49,17;1iag,61,8;1vj7,68,4;f0c,33,4;4j6,20,2	N:b4l,105,3~b4l,105,3
